            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nBefore continuing, we recommend studying the following texts first:\n\n- **Advancing an Order and the Complement**: presents the complement to 10 and explains when a sum advances to the next order (<htcite0>)\n- **Rereading**: presents the separation by orders, used here to decompose the minuend (<htcite1>)\n\nUnderstanding these texts will make it easier to follow the ideas presented here.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "cabc9843-35ef-4e4f-92fd-17eda864b55e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Advancing an Order and the Complement",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
